          "block_index": 0,
          "tag": "p",
          "text_as_printed": "Shamans can choose to be in one of four spirit bonds at any time. Spirit Bonds are like stances that other classes have, but unlike other classes the shaman's spirit bonds grow stronger as adventure level increases. Each bond has its own advantages.",
          "source_html": "<p>Shamans can choose to be in one of four spirit bonds at any time. Spirit Bonds are like stances that other classes have, but unlike other classes the shaman's spirit bonds grow stronger as adventure level increases. Each bond has its own advantages.</p>",
